lendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/52\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,838,510\/17263_sps_event.rev.1771444047.jpg 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/52\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,838,510\/17263_sps_event.rev.1771444047.jpg\" alt=\"'SPS Training Program: Food Safety' Event Thumbnail\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/52\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,838,510\/17263_sps_event.rev.1771444047.jpg 2x\" data-max-w=\"838\" data-max-h=\"510\" loading=\"lazy\" data-optimized=\"true\"\/>\n<\/picture>\n","image_info":["52","17263_sps_event","jpg","1","0,0,838,510","","","1",""]},{"id":"380258","ts_start":1774877400,"ts_end":1774893600,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/akamai","title":"GCRI &amp; Akamai Network Security Workshop","status":"1","location":"Wisenbaker Engineering Building","has_map":1,"latitude":"30.620771","longitude":"-96.338948","summary":"<p>\n  Join the <strong>Texas A&amp;M Global Cyber Research Institute<\/strong> for a network security workshop brought to you by <strong>Akamai.<\/strong><br \/>\n  <br \/>\n<\/p>\n<div>\n  <strong data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Breakfast: 8:00 AM - 8:30 AM&#160;<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  Morning Workshop: 8:30 AM \u2013 11:30 AM<br \/>\n  <br \/><\/strong>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>\n      <strong><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">8:30am - 9:30 am (Understanding Akamai Guardicore):<\/strong> <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal;\">A high-level introduction to Micro-segmentation and its role as the backbone of a Zero Trust architecture.<\/span><\/strong>\n    <\/li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>9:30am - 11:30 am:<\/strong> Participants will work through accessible, hands-on examples to learn how to visualize network traffic, enforce security policies, and isolate potential threats in real-time.\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n  <strong>Lunch Seminar: 12:00 PM \u2013 1:00 PM<br \/><\/strong>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n  <ul>\n    <li>We will dive deeper into the technical capabilities of Akamai Guardicore, focusing on two critical implementation strategies.\n    <\/li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>IT Network Infrastructure:<\/strong> How to secure large-scale networks and protect sensitive data through granular segmentation.\n    <\/li>\n    <li>\n      <strong>Lab &amp; Research Environments (OT Security):<\/strong> A specialized look at securing Operational Technology (OT) within research labs, essential for protecting high-stakes projects involving ground robots, drones, and experimental hardware.\n    <\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p>\n  <br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  Akamai Technologies is a leading cloud services provider, pioneering Content Delivery Network (CDN) and edge security solutions to speed up and protect digital experiences. Known for its globally distributed edge platform, it provides cloud computing, web performance optimization, and robust cybersecurity\u2014including Zero Trust and DDoS protection<strong><i><br\/><\/i><\/strong>\n<\/p>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/270\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1200,1200\/17477_GCRI_Seminar_Series_Single_Speaker_Template_7.rev.1773939186.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/webp\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/270\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1200,1200\/17477_GCRI_Seminar_Series_Single_Speaker_Template_7.rev.1773939186.webp 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/270\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1200,1200\/17477_GCRI_Seminar_Series_Single_Speaker_Template_7.rev.1773939186.webp 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https