igin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/58\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,600,800\/16839_Blanton-Tolbert.rev.1767804719.jpg\" alt=\"Blanton Tolbert\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/58\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,600,800\/16839_Blanton-Tolbert.rev.1767804719.jpg 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/58\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,600,800\/16839_Blanton-Tolbert.rev.1767804719.jpg 3x\" data-max-w=\"600\" data-max-h=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" data-optimized=\"true\"\/>\n<\/picture>\n","image_info":["58","16839_Blanton-Tolbert","jpg","1","0,0,600,800","Blanton Tolbert","https:\/\/isb.med.upenn.edu\/people\/blanton-s-tolbert\/","",""]},{"id":"373836","ts_start":1774888200,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/373836-eeb-seminar-series-spring-2026-rachel-short","title":"EEB Seminar Series Spring 2026: Rachel Short","status":"1","location":"Wehner Building","has_map":1,"latitude":"30.610611","longitude":"-96.350814","summary":"<p>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sdstate.edu\/directory\/rachel-short\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rachel Short<\/a>, Assistant Professor<br \/>\n  South Dakota State University\n<\/p>\n<p>\n  Title: TBA\n<\/p>\n<p>\n  Host: <a href=\"https:\/\/lawinglab.org\/team\/breann-richey\/\">Breann Richey<\/a> and Dr. <a href=\"https:\/\/eccb.tamu.edu\/people\/lawing-michelle\/\">Michelle Lawing<\/a> (ECCB)\n<\/p>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/233\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,531,398\/16898_short.rev.1768275679.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/webp\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/233\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,531,398\/16898_short.rev.1768275679.webp 2x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/233\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,531,398\/16898_short.rev.1768275679.png 2x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/233\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,531,398\/16898_short.rev.1768275679.png\" alt=\"'EEB Seminar Series Spring 2026: Rachel Short' Event Thumbnail\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-max-w=\"531\" data-max-h=\"398\" loading=\"lazy\" data-optimized=\"true\"\/>\n<\/picture>\n","image_info":["233","16898_short","png","1","0,0,531,398","","","1",""]},{"id":"371575","ts_start":1774890000,"ts_end":1774893600,"tz":"America\/Chicago","tz_abbrv":"CDT","tz_offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/371575-trec-seminar-omer-yilmaz-phd","title":"TREC Seminar: Omer Yilmaz, PhD","status":"1","location":"Kleberg Center","has_map":1,"latitude":"30.610614","longitude":"-96.347367","summary":"<div data-olk-copy-source=\"CalendarCompose\">\n  The Texas A&amp;M Regional Center of Excellence in Cancer invites you to a presentation by Omer Yilmaz, PhD. Dr. Yilmaz\u2019 presentation is titled, \u201c<i data-olk-copy-source=\"CalendarCompose\">Dietary Control of Stem Cells in Physiology and Disease<\/i>\u201d.<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  Omer Yilmaz is the Director of the MIT Stem Cell Initiative, Associate Professor of Biology at the Koch Institute for Integrative Cancer Research at MIT and a gastrointestinal pathologist at the Beth Isreal Deaconess Medical Center, Massachusetts General Hospital of Harvard Medical School. He is a graduate of the University of Michigan Medical School, where he performed his thesis work under the guidance of Professor Sean Morrison. He has also spent three years as a Postdoctoral Fellow in the laboratory of Professor David M. Sabatini, a member of the Whitehead and Koch Institutes. In 2014 he established his lab, which focuses on understanding how adult stem cells and their microenvironment adapt to diverse diets in the context of tissue regeneration, aging, and cancer initiation\/progression. His achievements, to date, have been recognized with a Harold Weintraub Award, AAAS Martin and Rose Wachtel Cancer Research Prize, Pew-Stewart Trust Fellowship, Sidney Kimmel Fellowship, Sabri Ulker International Science Prize and a V Scholar Award.<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n  TREC is proud to co-host this seminar with the Texas A&amp;M Department of Nutrition.\n<\/div>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/webp\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.webp 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.webp 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.png 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/301\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,1920,1080\/17202_Event_Template_4_-_Horizontal_14.rev.1770840465.png\" alt=\"A graphic containing Dr. Yilmaz&#x2019; headshot, the event date and location, and the pr