offset":-18000,"tz2_offset":-18000,"tz_format":"us","href":"event\/370704-aggiescall-serving-wreaths-across-america","title":"AggiesCALL - Serving Wreaths Across America","status":"1","location":"Wehner Building","has_map":1,"latitude":"30.610611","longitude":"-96.350814","summary":"<p>\n  AggiesCALL brings together Aggie students to make phone calls on behalf of nonprofits. Each 2-hour event includes phone training, an introduction to the nonprofit, and the time to make calls. Scripts are provided, and no prior experience is required. This event serves Wreaths Across America and will be held in Wehner 157.&#160;<br \/>\n  <br \/>\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/forms.office.com\/r\/4XZDb4NpQr\">Register Now<\/a>\n<\/p>","is_starred":"","image_src":"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Vertical-PositiveFormat.rev.1726259228.png","image_raw":"<picture class=\"lw_image\">\n\t<source type=\"image\/png\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Vertical-PositiveFormat.rev.1726259228.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Vertical-PositiveFormat.rev.1726259228.png 3x\" data-origin=\"responsive\"\/>\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Vertical-PositiveFormat.rev.1726259228.png\" alt=\"Mays Business School Logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/2x\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Vertical-PositiveFormat.rev.1726259228.png 2x, https:\/\/calendar.tamu.edu\/live\/image\/scale\/3x\/gid\/113\/width\/200\/height\/200\/crop\/1\/src_region\/0,0,2000,2000\/12744_Logo_Mays-Ve